[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# User-specific files
*.user
*.suo

# Rider / VS
.vs/
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

# Compiled Angular bundle — generated by `npm run build` (to frontend/dist/frontend/browser),
# copied into wwwroot at deploy time by .github/workflows/main_hekucoreapp.yml. Never committed:
# a stale bundle would serve a months-old UI at the API root under `dotnet run`. Develop with
# `ng serve`. The directory itself is kept (via .gitkeep) so .NET's static-files middleware
# finds it at startup.
/backend/Hekucoreapp.Api/wwwroot/*
!/backend/Hekucoreapp.Api/wwwroot/.gitkeep
